# ikea-shim env — anthropic→copilot gateway (W226).
# Machine config law: the FILLED copy lives ONLY in ~/.claude/local-llm/ikea.env
# (mode 600) and is never committed. Repos carry placeholders only.
# Mint the gho_ token on-device: bun ~/.claude/local-llm/ikea-shim.ts login
# (writes ~/.claude/local-llm/ikea-github.token, 0600, never printed).
IKEA_GITHUB_TOKEN=
# IKEA_PORT=4102
# IKEA_MODEL_MAP={"default":"gpt-5","haiku":"gpt-4.1-mini","sonnet":"gpt-5","opus":"gpt-5"}
